      "name": "담당 범위 보드",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "board",
      "description": "담당 범위 보드",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-board\">프로젝트별 담당 범위</div>",
      "css": ".ds-board{background:var(--board-white,#111d38);color:var(--ink,#ebe3cb);border:7px solid var(--board-frame,#2a3a5c);outline:1px solid var(--board-edge,#3a4a6c);outline-offset:-1px;border-radius:6px;padding:18px 16px 24px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--board-edge,#3a4a6c),0 22px 40px -28px color-mix(in srgb,var(--dark,#0b1428) 80%,transparent)}"
