      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "work-sheet",
      "description": "담당 기능 판면",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sheet\"><strong>관리자 운영</strong><p>해빗 생성·수정·복제와 이벤트 관리 화면을 개발했습니다.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sheet{color:var(--ink,#ebe3cb);background:var(--board-white,#111d38);border:1px solid var(--board-frame,#2a3a5c);border-top:2px solid var(--marker-blue,#ebe3cb);padding:clamp(20px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.7}"
    },
    {
      "name": "조건 선택 칩",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "condition-chip",
      "description": "조건 선택 칩",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">명령 만료</button>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{color:var(--ink,#ebe3cb);background:transparent;border:1px solid currentColor;padding:8px 14px;min-height:44px;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 120ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-chip:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#ebe3cb);outline-offset:4px}.ds-chip:active{transform:translateY(1px)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-chip:active{transform:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "선택한 조건 칩",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "condition-chip-selected",
      "description": "선택한 조건 칩",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\">명령 만료</button>",
      "css": ".ds-selected{color:var(--paper,#0e1830);background:var(--ink,#ebe3cb);border:1px solid var(--ink,#ebe3cb);padding:8px 14px;min-height:44px;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 120ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1)}.ds-selected:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-selected:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink,#ebe3cb);outline-offset:4px}.ds-selected:active{transform:translateY(1px)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-selected:active{transform:none}}"
